# sys-heatran-caught (docs/research/postgame.md §3): Stark Mountain room 3, Heatran.
# A constructed start: the game completed, the National Pokédex, Buck talked to in the Battleground and room 3 at state
# 1, so the room's on-transition shows Heatran (FLAG_HIDE_STARK_MOUNTAIN_ROOM_3_HEATRAN cleared). A on Heatran:
# FLAG_BATTLED_STARK_MOUNTAIN_ROOM_3_HEATRAN, state 2, the L50 legendary battle; caught with a Master Ball:
# check_won_battle, the Vs. Seeker level 5 unlock, check_did_not_capture FALSE, FLAG_CAUGHT_HEATRAN.
party 0 platinum:SPECIES_GARCHOMP 70 platinum:MOVE_DRAGON_CLAW
give item platinum:ITEM_MASTER_BALL 1
set flag platinum:FLAG_GAME_COMPLETED true
set state pokedex.national true
set flag platinum:FLAG_TALKED_TO_BATTLEGROUND_BUCK true
set var platinum:VAR_STARK_MOUNTAIN_ROOM_3_STATE 1
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_STARK_MOUNTAIN_ROOM_3 7 7 up
until idle
+0 assert flag platinum:FLAG_HIDE_STARK_MOUNTAIN_ROOM_3_HEATRAN false
+0 assert state objects[localId=1].z 6
+0 press a
+1 release a
advance text 3000
battle catch platinum:ITEM_MASTER_BALL 20000
+0 assert battle scripted platinum:SPECIES_HEATRAN caught
advance text 20000
until idle 3000
+0 assert flag platinum:FLAG_CAUGHT_HEATRAN true
+0 assert flag platinum:FLAG_BATTLED_STARK_MOUNTAIN_ROOM_3_HEATRAN true
+0 assert flag platinum:FLAG_UNLOCKED_VS_SEEKER_LVL_5 true
+0 assert flag platinum:FLAG_HIDE_STARK_MOUNTAIN_ROOM_3_HEATRAN true
+0 assert flag platinum:FLAG_MAP_LOCAL_REMOVE_OBJECT false
+0 assert var platinum:VAR_STARK_MOUNTAIN_ROOM_3_STATE 2
+0 assert party 1 platinum:SPECIES_HEATRAN
+0 assert state party[1].level 50
